    "",
    "chore: update handoff \u2014 runtime_mappings status declaration (#658)",
    "",
    "Records the session that carried the config-key status declaration to the",
    "migration install surface, corrects the mutation-guidance comment that was",
    "inverted for the files that change touched, and notes that the tracker",
    "disposition written earlier in that session was drawn wider than the evidence",
    "supported.",
    "",
    "Adds the panel-convergence section to the review-process learnings: two lenses",
    "agreeing is not two observations when both reached the conclusion through the",
    "same probe, and an enumeration is only as wide as the search that produced it.",
    "",
    "Parks one friction entry \u2014 two panel lenses each running the full suite",
    "concurrently produced a failure neither reproduces alone \u2014 for accumulation",
    "rather than filing, since the concurrency correlation is strong but no",
    "mechanism is identified. The friction log is over its line budget; graduating",
    "the inbox is the triage workflow's write, not this one's.",
    "",
    "Reconciles the parity plan's Phase 5 paragraph, which said the config-key work",
    "needed tracker disposition rather than implementation.",
    "",
    "The archive sweep moved one session block into the history file.",
    "",
    "Reviewed by the fallback panel at the merged head: adversarial filed nothing,",
    "correctness filed one Low on the friction-log budget which was declined with a",
    "reason on the pull request."
  ],
